  - Compile initramfs image
  - Rename initramfs image to ''firmware_WHR-1166DHP.ram''
  - Setup tftp server at 192.168.11.168
  - While plugging it in, hold down the AOSS button until you see it grab the image
  - Load initramfs image via tftp
  - Backup the stock FW
  - Sysupgrade with a sysupgrade image for a permanent install


